  "researchGoal": "I am an AI researcher. My goal is to help automate vision. Can we build models that curate their own data, extract their own supervision, and adapt on the fly to changes in the real world?",
  "researchOverview": "I want visual models to take a more active role in their own learning: choosing useful data, learning from new observations, and adapting efficiently as conditions change. This goal connects my work in self-supervised, continual, and vision-language learning with applications from medical diagnostics to industrial visual intelligence.",
